En|io-refused|the server refuses connections (the port is closed or the server is down)
En|io-reset|the connection to the server broke
En|io-aborted|the connection to the server broke
En|io-pipe|the connection to the server broke
En|io-eof|the connection to the server broke
En|io-timedout|the server did not answer in time
En|io-netunreach|no network, or the server is unreachable
En|io-hostunreach|no network, or the server is unreachable
En|io-other|network: os said
En|io-dns|server not found: check its name (DNS)
En|io-dns2|server not found: check its name (DNS)
En|timeout-connecting|the server did not answer in time (connecting)
En|timeout-server greeting|the server did not answer in time (server greeting)
En|timeout-search answer|the server did not answer in time (search answer)
En|timeout-SMTP answer|the server did not answer in time (SMTP answer)
En|timeout-operation|the server did not answer in time (operation)
En|timeout-connecting to the list server|the server did not answer in time (connecting to the list server)
En|timeout-list server answer|the server did not answer in time (list server answer)
En|timeout-HTTP answer|the server did not answer in time (HTTP answer)
En|timeout-something else|the server did not answer in time (something else)
En|tls|TLS: unexpected error: handshake
En|certificate|untrusted certificate mail.example.org: the reason
En|no-tls|the server does not support encryption (STARTTLS); the password was not sent
En|invalid-host|invalid server name: bad host
En|auth|the server rejected the login: no way
En|auth-mechanism|the server offers no supported login method (offers: CRAM-MD5); PLAIN or LOGIN is needed
En|imap-unavailable|the server accepted the password but did not open the mailbox over IMAP. On Exchange: IMAP is off for the mailbox (ImapEnabled) or the MSExchangeIMAP4BE service is not running
En|imap-no|IMAP: refused: Internal error
En|imap-bad|IMAP: command not accepted: bad command
En|imap-io|IMAP: the connection to the server broke
En|imap-lost|IMAP: the connection to the server broke
En|smtp-421|the server limits the sending rate (Exchange allows 5 messages a minute by default); the message will go later (server: 421 the words)
En|smtp-sendas|no right to send on behalf of this address (Send As) (server: 550 the words)
En|smtp-535|wrong user name or password (server: 535 the words)
En|smtp-573|wrong user name or password (server: 550 the words)
En|smtp-530|the server requires a login before sending (server: 530 the words)
En|smtp-5757|the server requires a login before sending (server: 554 the words)
En|smtp-552|the message is too large for the server (server: 552 the words)
En|smtp-534|the message is too large for the server (server: 550 the words)
En|smtp-511|the recipient address does not exist (server: 550 the words)
En|smtp-5110|the recipient address does not exist (server: 550 the words)
En|smtp-571|the server refused the message (no permission, or rejected by policy) (server: 550 the words)
En|smtp-451|temporary server error, the message will go later (server: 451 the words)
En|smtp-plain|the server answered 550: the words
En|smtp-hello|the server did not accept the client's greeting (EHLO host.local), before any login: 501 bad
En|too-large|the message is 12000000 bytes, over the server's limit of 10000000 bytes
En|compose|the message could not be built: no sender
En|store|local database: Query returned no rows
En|closed|the server closed the connection
En|bye|the server closed the connection: shutting down
En|protocol|unexpected answer from the server: odd
En|not-found|message not found
En|parse|the message could not be parsed
En|unreadable|stored data could not be read
En|ews-busy|the server is busy (Exchange: ErrorServerBusy)
En|ews-busy-wait|the server is busy and asks to wait 2 s (Exchange: ErrorServerBusy)
En|ews-item|the message is no longer on the server (Exchange: ErrorItemNotFound)
En|ews-folder|the folder is no longer on the server (Exchange: ErrorFolderNotFound)
En|ews-size|the message is too large for the server (Exchange: ErrorMessageSizeExceeded)
En|ews-sendas|no right to send on behalf of this address (Send As) (Exchange: ErrorSendAsDenied)
En|ews-quota|the mailbox is full (Exchange: ErrorQuotaExceeded)
En|ews-denied|access denied (Exchange: ErrorAccessDenied)
En|ews-unknown|Exchange answered ErrorWhatever: msg
En|busy-retrying|the Exchange server is busy; the mailbox will try again in 3 s
En|busy-not|the Exchange server is busy; nothing was done, try again in 1 s
En|http-auth|Exchange accepts only Negotiate on EWS; Depesha signs in with Basic or NTLM. Ask the administrator to enable one of them: Set-WebServicesVirtualDirectory -WindowsAuthentication $true
En|paused|the mailbox is paused until its settings are fixed
En|private|192.168.0.1 is an address in a private network; Depesha does not send requests there from a letter
En|cache-too-new|the local mail cache was saved by a newer version of Depesha (format 20, this version reads up to 18). Install the newer version; the cache was left as it is
En|folder-changed|the folder changed on the server before the action ran; nothing was done, try again
En|label-stripping|The label is still being removed, try again in a minute
En|label-check|this server has no UIDPLUS: the label check cannot remove its test letter, so it is not run
En|copy-refused|quota says no
Ru|io-refused|сервер не принимает соединения (порт закрыт или сервер выключен)
Ru|io-reset|соединение с сервером оборвалось
